Subject: [PATCH] dvfel: prepare TV-led output in Kodi's normal display lifecycle

Keep the existing first-picture configuration and refresh-rate selection.
Only a confirmed FEL session with the automatic-output marker bypasses
native DV processing, and it retains dual-layer hardware decoding. Guard
carrier visibility/PQ until the normal window transaction acknowledges the
output owner. Restore the original GUI through the same display lifecycle.
Ordinary playback keeps its original path. Requires the 9911 carrier patch.
---

